      "value": "@{5f99a97e4d4afb3fb6674ca5|full_name}: Personally, I'd like to remove the line, reduce the outlining to something thinner and more opaque. So I think if they add this more options may be better than a mode as if you and me may want different things, I can only imagine all of the other preferences everyone has.\nI feel like if this was family guy there'd be a cut away right now, but I don't have the budget for that kind of thing :/",
