      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5a766b8a0868b44b53569ce4|full_name}: The dotted lines help me know which hand it is that is selecting an object, in other games I have had issues when laying down sometimes, I would end up trying to pick up an object, but it's highlighted by my left hand by chance when trying to grab it with my right.\nI think to combat this, users should be able to change the color of the outline depending on which hand is able to grab the object in question.\nsay a dark purple for left, and a soft pink for right, something like that.\nThis way you can get rid of the dotted lines, but still maintain which hand is able to grab.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
